I'll keep it short, because I restored my game last night at like 10pm 
or so and NEVER STOPPED... sleep? WHO NEEDS IT?!!!!

Finally ascended fair and square after 13 years of playing this game. I 
think the key to this one was the absurd amount of time I spent at a 
dungeon level 1 altar beefing myself up.
Actually what happened was I went for protection racket as usual, and 
made it to minetown, but the altar wasn't co-aligned, and I wasn't 
willing to convert it and get swatted down by the priest of anhur.

After buying 9 points of protection and scrounging up whatever I could 
find, I didn't bother going lower than minetown and went back up to the 
altar on level 1. I must have spent well over 50,000 turns there 
sacrificing and getting death drops.I wasn't getting the spellbooks I 
wanted, and more importantly it was taking ABSOLUTELY FOREVER to get a 
damn bag of holding. To top it all off, I got up in levels sacrificed a 
doppleganger by accident (damn thing was disguised as an ORC...) and 
lost my protection.

Man I got pissed but figured Oh well lets see how far I can take it. 
Spent more countless hours at that altar collecting tons of unicorn 
horns in an oilskin sack.

Just kept sacrificing and eventually got back about 6 points, and 
started dancing with what seemed like a bottomless succubus. Got up to 
level 27, then went the rest of the way with a wraith and a couple of !oGL.

Eventually the create monster book timed out and I had to try to drag 
all my unicorn horns downstairs, being strained... got sick of it about 
3 levels down and just stashed them.

Went back to minetown where I found I had a book of polymorph that I 
hadn't IDed. Then things started to shape up. Started spinning the 
unicorn horns and other stuff around till I had THREE bags of holding 
and more books than I could count.

Throughout the rest of the game I kept polying any scroll I could find 
for enchant armor and eventually wound up with some nice stuff.

Didn't get any wishes until I hit the castle, but by then I was an 
absolute tank, mashing my way through everything. Figured eventually the 
RNG would get me in the endgame, pull me into the lava and surround me 
with archons like so many times before.

My ascension run went really really quick, I was only bumped back like 3 
times, didn't really notice because I was clicking my way through with 
mouse travel and had cleared the paths already long before.

Was sure the planes would get me, but strangely no, and I had a 0:4 
crystal ball ready this time. Surprisingly got through fire real quick, 
and no DAMN ARCHONS! Whee!

Once I got to Astral, I figured ok I'll hang a left and mash through, 
got lucky cuz that was the altar. Only had to face Death, mowed him over 
easy. Rodney of course was a total joke, he never got a single spell off 
or a hit on me.

Since I don't have the endgame dump build, I just took 3 jpg screenshots 
for the memories... Don't really know how to post jpg's to usenet.

Well ok that WASNT short but hey its my YAFAP so bleah!

Anyway in summary MEEEEEEEEEEEE HAPPPPPPPYYYYYYYYYYY!!!!!!!! 
